      "fact": "Storage acknowledgement lives in source manifest; inspect requires live batch and source pages. It is not an independent historical report proof."
    },
    {
      "id": "source_cleanup_pinned",
      "fact": "Dataset pin trigger prevents page purge or source deletion while fact references remain; removing it would lose existing evidence safety."
    },
    {
      "id": "historical_identity_dependencies",
      "fact": "Mapping FK/current mapping_review_state and immutable FX FK must be distinguished from historical context required for reports."
    },
    {
      "id": "erasure_addressability",
      "fact": "Whole installation deletes facts before sources. Customer erase locates affected Dataset rows through source page/batch linkage; after normal raw deletion the same scope needs retained authoritative addressability."
    },
    {
      "id": "event_grain",
      "fact": "Klaviyo product sales is per Ordered Product event, not a daily anonymous aggregate. Event-ID retention/grain/privacy cannot be silently reclassified."
    }
